WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,080
Roujia, can you accompany me to the toilet? Please

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,040
Already so big

3
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:07,080
You need someone to accompany Shaoqi when you go to the toilet, right?

4
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:12,710
I won’t complain about eating weird food.

5
00:00:12,710 --> 00:00:14,070
But eating in the bathroom

6
00:00:14,070 --> 00:00:15,070
What is this habit?

7
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:17,390
Isn't this a condition for him to eat weird food?

8
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:18,430
Then I'll go to the toilet

9
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:27,690
Please wait for me. I'll be fine.

10
00:00:27,690 --> 00:00:29,250
Let's go. You go out first.

11
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:30,290
I go to the toilet

12
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:31,690
Then I'll be here with you

13
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:32,650
No need for you to accompany me

14
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:34,620
I rushed to the toilet alone

15
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:35,900
You go back to work first

16
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,100
If there is a customer paying the bill

17
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,140
Ask the guest to wait

18
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:43,750
I'll come out right away

19
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:45,840
Why are you alone and the other one?

20
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:46,960
He said he didn't need me to accompany him

21
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,500
Going to the toilet

22
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:49,580
Then why didn't he say anything just now?

23
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:56,860
He also has to go to the toilet.

24
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,440
My rules are locked inside

25
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:01,400
Clean the bathroom toilet once you use it

26
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:02,600
Continuous use is not allowed

27
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,800
Otherwise, non-existent things will appear in the toilet

28
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:17,150
Why can't the door open?

29
00:01:17,150 --> 00:01:18,710
Do I need to say that bathrooms are dangerous?

30
00:01:18,710 --> 00:01:19,990
It should be you who take the initiative to ask me.

31
00:01:19,990 --> 00:01:21,030
Am I your nanny?

32
00:01:21,030 --> 00:01:23,030
I need to remind you of everything

33
00:01:23,030 --> 00:01:24,430
when guests

34
00:01:24,430 --> 00:01:36,300
Just keep quiet. I'm done.

35
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:37,980
You are summoned to go to the toilet and go quickly.

36
00:01:37,980 --> 00:01:40,380
As expected, you old player has a lot of cards in your hand.

37
00:01:40,380 --> 00:01:41,460
In case of breaking the rules

38
00:01:41,460 --> 00:01:42,580
How could he be so calm?

39
00:01:42,580 --> 00:01:44,300
It seems my worries are unnecessary

40
00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:45,580
what did you encounter

41
00:01:45,580 --> 00:01:46,500
What happened

42
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:47,810
No

43
00:01:47,810 --> 00:01:49,330
Could it be that something does not exist?

44
00:01:49,330 --> 00:01:50,930
Worthy doesn’t have to be weird

45
00:01:50,930 --> 00:01:52,770
but a certain phenomenon

46
00:01:52,770 --> 00:01:56,180
Did you encounter anything wrong? No?
